"Bluetooth: light bar, report rate, adaptive triggers, gyro aiming, and an "
"Xbox 360 controller for games with your own button layout. Runs in the "
"background with the desktop service; stop sc-controller or DS4Windows-like "
"tools first, or both will drive the controller."
