#: xcontrol/desktop_page.py:426
msgid ""
"Install xss-lock: it starts the locker when you're idle and before the "
"computer sleeps."
msgstr ""
"Installiere xss-lock: Es startet das Sperrprogramm, wenn du untätig bist und "
